Package: Houdini
Type: Package
Title: Automatic Table & Figure Insertion into Data Containing Documents
Version: 0.2.0
Author: Aaron Godwood
Maintainer: Aaron Godwood <yourself@somewhere.net>
Description: Facilitates the automatic insertion of data tables & figures into documents.
    Can pull data from .rtf files and .sas7bdat files and will insert them as tables or images into a word doc at a specified bookmark.
    Bookmarks and filenames must be referenced in a provided excel document as well as any other filtering requirements.
